\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3385em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5858em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 Maxwell 体的弹性模量和黏性系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 Kelvin 体的对应参数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"围岩稳定性分析方法\">围岩稳定性分析方法</h3><p>深部巷道围岩稳定性评价的核心方法包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>极限平衡法</td>\n<td>结构面控制型失稳</td>\n<td>节理产状、摩擦角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值模拟法</td>\n<td>复杂应力路径</td>\n<td>本构模型参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛约束法</td>\n<td>支护设计优化</td>\n<td>地层反力曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能量法</td>\n<td>岩爆风险判别</td>\n<td>弹性应变能密度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>收敛约束法（特征曲线法）通过地层反力曲线（GRC）和支护反力曲线（SCC）的交点确定围岩-支护系统的平衡状态，是深部巷道支护时机选择的重要工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三轴试验技术\">三轴试验技术</h3><p>深部岩体力学参数的获取依赖高压三轴试验系统。现代深部岩石力学试验要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>围压能力：≥ 100 MPa（模拟 4000 m 以上埋深）</li>\n<li>温度控制：室温至 200°C（模拟深地热环境）</li>\n<li>孔隙水压：可独立施加，模拟高水压耦合</li>\n<li>声发射监测：实时追踪微破裂演化过程</li>\n</ul>\n<p>中国矿业大学千米深井围岩控制试验系统能够模拟 1500 m 埋深条件下的真三轴应力状态，配合 CT 扫描实现岩体内部损伤的可视化表征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年深部岩体力学领域的重要进展包括：深部岩体真三轴蠕变-渗流耦合试验平台投入运行，首次实现了温度-应力-渗流三场耦合条件下的长时蠕变数据采集；基于机器学习的岩体本构模型参数反演方法取得突破，利用少量试验数据即可预测不同应力路径下的力学响应；数字岩心技术将 CT 扫描精度提升至微米级，结合离散元方法实现了从微观裂纹萌生到宏观破坏的多尺度模拟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某矿井巷道埋深 1200 m，围岩为中等强度砂岩（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{ci} = 80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span> MPa，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma = 26</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span></span></span></span></span> kN/m³），试估算原岩垂直应力，并判断该深度条件下岩体是否可能发生脆-延转变。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么 Hoek-Brown 准则在深部高围压条件下可能高估岩体强度，并提出至少两种可能的修正思路。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某深部巷道围岩在开挖后 6 个月内持续收敛变形，试从蠕变力学角度分析其原因，并讨论如何通过试验确定蠕变模型参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>对比极限平衡法和数值模拟法在深部围岩稳定性分析中的优缺点，说明各自的最佳适用条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>深部岩体的&quot;三高&quot;环境（高应力、高温、高水压）之间存在怎样的耦合效应？这些耦合如何影响岩体的长期强度？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>深部岩体力学研究的核心在于准确描述高应力、高温和高水压耦合条件下岩体的变形与破坏行为。从应力-应变本构关系到蠕变流变特性，从强度准则修正到稳定性综合评价，每个环节都需要突破浅部岩体力学的既有框架。掌握这些理论基础，是进行深地工程安全设计与围岩控制的先决条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"深部岩体力学","id":"深部岩体力学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"深部应力环境特征","id":"深部应力环境特征"},{"level":3,"text":"本构模型与强度准则","id":"本构模型与强度准则"},{"level":3,"text":"蠕变与流变力学","id":"蠕变与流变力学"},{"level":3,"text":"围岩稳定性分析方法","id":"围岩稳定性分析方法"},{"level":3,"text":"三轴试验技术","id":"三轴试验技术"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"深地地质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/rock-mechanics-geotechnics/geotechnical-engineering"}}